---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Scaling a Profitable, Financially Independent UX & Design Unit"
  summary="Leading and running a financially independent design unit at NFQ Technologies, with full P&L ownership, resourcing, and commercial decision-making."
  role="Head of UX & Design"
  timeline="2020 - 2024"
  platform="B2B & B2C Web"
>
  <!-- OVERVIEW -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Overview</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Executive summary</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          This case study describes my first executive-level leadership role as <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">Head of UX & Design at NFQ Technologies</strong>,
          where I transitioned from an individual contributor into full ownership of a financially independent design unit.
        </p>
        <div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
            <li>Team scaled from <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">2 designers</strong> to <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">10 designers</strong></li>
            <li>Annual revenue grew from ~<strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">€100k</strong> to nearly <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">€480k</strong></li>
            <li>Unit achieved its <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">highest revenue</strong> in NFQ’s 18-year history</li>
            <li>Operated with <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">85%+ utilization</strong> efficiency</li>
            <li>Design became a repeatable driver of new business, upsell, and long-term retention</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          The role combined people leadership, service strategy, sales support, and full <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">P&amp;L accountability</strong>,
          marking my first experience running design as a standalone business within a service company.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SITUATION -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Situation</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Context & problem</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          When I stepped into the role, the design function was small and under‑leveraged from a business perspective.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Team size: <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">2 designers</strong>; annual revenue ~<strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">€100k</strong></li>
          <li>Design positioned mainly as delivery support; limited commercial ownership</li>
          <li>Services centered on UI/UX execution for web and apps</li>
          <li>Minimal control over utilization, pricing, or growth planning</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          Meanwhile, NFQ was scaling engineering and consulting services - an opportunity to position design as a
          strategic, revenue‑generating partner rather than a cost center.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TASK -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Task</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Goals & objectives</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          Transform UX & Design into a mature, scalable, and profitable business unit while maintaining delivery quality and a strong culture.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Full <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">P&amp;L ownership</strong> for the unit</li>
          <li>Scale team capacity in line with revenue growth</li>
          <li>Define clear value proposition and service portfolio</li>
          <li>Ensure high utilization without burnout</li>
          <li>Support new client acquisition and grow existing accounts</li>
          <li>Establish career paths, processes, and leadership structures</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          This required shifting from a senior designer mindset to executive decision‑making across finance, operations, sales,
          and people management.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ACTION -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Action</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Process & solution</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">I drove the transformation across four parallel dimensions.</p>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED]">Building a scalable team</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Grew from 2 to <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">10 designers</strong> across seniorities</li>
          <li>Clear roles, growth paths, performance expectations, mentorship, and regular feedback</li>
          <li>Invested in culture, psychological safety, and added a team‑lead layer for scale</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Owning financial and operational performance</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Budgeting, forecasting, pricing, and profitability management</li>
          <li>Maintained <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">85%+ utilization</strong>, balancing delivery with sales/presales</li>
          <li>Staffing decisions based on pipeline and margin targets</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Expanding services and value proposition</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>User research, discovery, and usability testing</li>
          <li>UX audits, expert reviews, e‑commerce evaluations</li>
          <li>Design systems and long‑term design partnerships</li>
          <li>Positioned design earlier in engagements to influence product strategy</li>
          <li>Shifted conversations from “screens” to outcomes, risk reduction, and business value</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Driving growth through sales and partnerships</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Active role in sales/presales, pitches, and solution shaping</li>
          <li>Closed new clients by demonstrating strategic UX value</li>
          <li>Grew revenue via upsell and retention; unified with engineering/account teams</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RESULT -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Result</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Outcome & impact</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          By the end of my tenure, UX & Design had become one of NFQ’s strongest‑performing support units from both a financial and strategic perspective.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA]">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Revenue increased nearly <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">5×</strong>, from ~€100k to ~€480k annually</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Record‑high revenue for the design unit in NFQ’s history</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Sustained <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">85%+ utilization</strong> while scaling</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Design became a trusted contributor to acquisition and account growth</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Established a resilient team structure capable of operating independently</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          Most importantly, this role marked my transition from senior practitioner to business leader - proving that design can operate with
          full commercial accountability while maintaining craft quality, team health, and long‑term impact.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</CaseStudyLayout>

